  "application_type_full": "Householder planning permission",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposed ground floor rear extension, by reason of its unacceptable size, scale and location, will result in an excessive loss of garden amenity space, to the detriment of quality of accommodation and living conditions of current and future occupiers. This is contrary to Policies LP2 (Development and Amenity) of the Hackney Local Plan LP33 (2020) and D3 (D3 Optimising site capacity through the design-led approach) and D6 (Housing quality and standards) of the London Plan (2021) and the Hackney Residential Extensions and Alterations Supplementary Planning Document (2025).&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposed ground floor rear extension, by reason of it&#x27;s inappropriate scale, location and design, would result in an overly prominent and incongruous addition, that would be out of keeping with the character and appearance of the host building and wider terrace of which it forms part. As such, the proposed development is contrary to policies D1 (London’s form, character, and capacity for growth), D3 (Optimising site capacity through the design-led approach), D4 (Delivering good design) of the London Plan (2021) and policies LP1 (Design Quality and Local Character) of the Hackney Local Plan (2020) and the Hackney Residential Extensions and Alterations Supplementary Planning Document (2025).&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
